      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Acknowledgements",
      "pageStart": 8,
      "pageEnd": 10,
      "target": "../sections/sec-001-acknowledgements.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "The World Health Organization (WHO) is grateful for the contributions that many individuals and \norganizations have made over several years to the development of this guideline.\nThis guideline was coordinated by Garrett Mehl, Lale Say and Tigest Tamrat of the WHO \nDepartment of Reproductive Health and Research, in collaboration with departments across WHO. \nMarita Sporstøl Fønhus, Claire Glenton and Simon Lewin from the Norwegian Institute of Public \nHealth provided methodological support as members of the technical team and prepared the \nevidence-to-decision frameworks.\nThe following WHO staf",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Thanks the WHO coordinators, the Norwegian Institute of Public Health methods team and the many WHO staff and regional advisers. It names guideline development group members, systematic review authors, external reviewers, observers and funders.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
