    {
      "id": "library/10665-311941/blocks/prose-sec-020",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Decision-making and formulation of recommendations",
      "pageStart": 53,
      "pageEnd": 55,
      "target": "../sections/sec-020-27-decision-making-and-formulation-of-recommenda.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "recommendations\nThe WHO steering group provided the evidence-to-decision frameworks, including evidence \nsummaries, GRADE evidence profiles, and other documents related to each guideline question, to \nthe GDG in advance of the final in-person GDG meeting. The purpose of the final GDG meeting \nwas to reach a majority decision on each recommendation, including its direction and conditions, \nbased on the evidence and implementation experiences presented. During this face-to-face \nmeeting in June 2018, and under the leadership of the GDG co-chairs (Annex 3), GDG members \ncollectively reviewed the",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes how the guideline development group reviewed evidence-to-decision frameworks at a June 2018 meeting and reached recommendations through discussion and voting. It defines the recommendation categories, including recommended, not recommended, recommended only in specific contexts and recommended only in the context of rigorous research. It also explains how members with declared conflicts of interest could join discussions but not vote on the related questions.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
          "model": "not-disclosed"
        },
        "draftedAt": "2026-11-11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "library/10665-311941/blocks/prose-sec-021",
      "types": [
        "folio-assistant-core:Prose",
        "doco:Section"
      ],
      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Document preparation and peer review",
      "pageStart": 55,
      "pageEnd": 56,
      "target": "../sections/sec-021-28-document-preparation-and-peer-review.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Following the final GDG meeting, the responsible technical officer from the WHO steering group \nprepared a draft of the full guideline document that reflected as accurately as possible the \ndeliberations and decisions of the GDG. Other members of the steering group and the technical \nteam provided comments on the draft document before it was sent electronically to the GDG \nmembers for further comments and to the external review group for peer review. The technical \nteam reviewed the feedback provided by the GDG and the external review group and revised the \ndraft guideline as needed. After the",
      "truncated": true,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Explains how the draft guideline was prepared after the final meeting, reviewed by the guideline group and external peer reviewers, revised, and returned to members for approval.",
        "state": "draft",
        "draftedBy": {
          "kind": "agent",
          "id": "claude-code",
