      "kind": "prose",
      "title": "Future research",
      "pageStart": 110,
      "pageEnd": 110,
      "target": "../sections/sec-037-5-future-research.md",
      "narrative": null,
      "content": "This chapter on future research highlights crosscutting evidence gaps observed across \na range of interventions in relation to effectiveness, resource use and cost-effectiveness, \nand gender, equity and rights. In addition, specific research questions are provided for each \nof the interventions, based on the gaps identified through the evidence-to-decision \nframework and GDG.",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Introduces the chapter on future research, which covers cross-cutting evidence gaps on effectiveness, cost, gender, equity and rights, plus specific research questions for each intervention.",
