      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Describes how WHO will disseminate the digital health guideline in full and condensed versions through regional offices, global digital health networks, regional consultations and webinars. It also mentions an implementation guide that will provide a stepwise process for fitting recommended interventions to local needs and contexts.",
